@param vm: io.availe.kreplicadocs.model.view.GuideViewModel

<p>If you're new to KReplica, I implore you to check the <a href="/playground" hx-get="/fragments/playground"
                                                             hx-target=".main-content" hx-push-url="/playground"
                                                            hx-indicator=".page-progress">Playground</a> as well. Since
    this is a code generation tool, I believe it’s very useful to see a side-by-side view of the input and codegen
    output.</p>